OL,3,GNEWSATwo accidents in hours 'highlight
OL,4,Atraffic fears'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo crashes in 24 hours near the site
OL,7,Fof a proposed housing development
OL,8,Fhighlight residents' concerns over
OL,9,Fdangerous traffic, a campaigner has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FIn March, Stockton Council refused
OL,13,FTaylor Wimpey's #133m plan for up to
OL,14,F600 homes on land east of Holdenfields
OL,15,FFarm, Green Lane in Yarm.
OL,17,FResidents who gave evidence to a public
OL,18,Finquiry into the rejected proposal
OL,19,Fraised concerns over nearby Leven Bank,
OL,20,Fwhich was described as a known
OL,21,F"accident blackspot".
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
