OL,3,GNEWSATwo accidents in hours 'highlight
OL,4,Atraffic fears'
OL,5,
OL,6,FResident and Yarm town councillor
OL,7,FYvonne Wallace said two crashes in a
OL,8,Fmatter of hours at Low Leven on Monday,
OL,9,Fone of the areas surveyed by the
OL,10,Finquiry's inspector Geoff Underwood
OL,11,Fdays before, demonstrated the relevance
OL,12,Fof residents' concerns.
